    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d52">

                <pb facs="0129" n="37" sameAs="frus:frus1943CairoTehran/pg37"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Roosevelt
                    Papers: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Prime Minister Churchill to President Roosevelt</hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d52-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-10-22">22 October 1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Most secret and personal from Former Naval
                        Person to President. Number 469.</p>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>Your 391. I am instructing Eden to
                        back you up to the full but I do not think Ankara would be possible; first,
                        because of security, and secondly, because there are the Taurus Mountains to
                        cross.</item>
                </list>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p>
                <list>
                    <label>4.</label>
                    <item>Whatever happens we have got to meet soon.</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
